# The benchmark crate is excluded from the workspace (see /Cargo.toml), so
# cargo resolves it against the library crates by path and writes its own lock
# file and build directory here. Neither is a product artifact: the lock file
# only pins the path dependencies this crate re-exports, and the workspace lock
# at /Cargo.lock remains the authority for everything the product builds.
Cargo.lock
target/
